# Docker matches these patterns per path component: a bare `target/` only
# matched the repository root, so mobile/src-tauri/target (50 GB) plus the
# generated iOS/Android trees were sent with every build context. `**/` makes
# them match at any depth.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
dist-release/
**/src-tauri/binaries/
src/src/assets/agent-icons/*.dmg
.git/
.gitignore
**/*.log
# No Linux image builds the mobile app; its gen/ and native/mosh trees are
# several GB of generated Xcode/Gradle and vendored build output.
mobile/
